{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>and my hand found.</b> לחיל, wealth, like את החיל הזה (Deuteronomy 8:17)." "<b>nestlings.</b> נודד כנף is a verb in the active voice, and כנף is the object, because he likened them to eggs, and chicks hatch from them."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra explains that לחיל here means wealth/property, as in the cited verse."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:11.051366902Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}